# abd-mfe-monorepo

Turborepo with three apps under `apps/`:

| App | Path | Role |
|---|---|---|
| Host (PulseBoard) | `apps/host/` | Next.js 15 — main SaaS learning app |
| Shell remote | `apps/shell/` | Vite MFE — `MicroShellApp` |
| State remote | `apps/state/` | Vite MFE — shared Redux store |

## Layout (host)

- `apps/host/src/app/(marketing)/` — public pages
- `apps/host/src/app/(dashboard)/dashboard/` — protected app
- `apps/host/src/app/(auth)/` — login
- `apps/host/src/app/api/` — Route Handlers
- `apps/host/src/components/mfe/` — Module Federation host integration
- `apps/host/src/lib/mfe/` — Vite remote loader, share scope, URLs

## Conventions

- Use `@/` path alias within each app
- Run `npm run dev:mfe` from monorepo root for local MFE dev
- Auth cookie: `pulseboard_session`; middleware guards `/dashboard/*`
- `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` Vercel env vars must be plain (not Sensitive)
